.TH SDL_FILE 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_FILE \- A macro that reports the current file being compiled.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_assert.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_FILE    __FILE_NAME__
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This macro is only defined if it isn\(aqt already defined, so to override it (perhaps with something that doesn\(aqt provide path information at all, so build machine information doesn\(aqt leak into public binaries), apps can define this macro before including SDL\[char46]h or
.BR SDL_assert \[char46]h\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This macro is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

